  "body": "I have Synapse 0.23.1 homeserver that store many Remote Media files and I want to clean up them.\r\n\r\nI try to use [Purge Remote Media API](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/master/docs/admin_api/purge_remote_media.rst) with fresh timestamp (current time in unix timestamp), but result of the command is `\"deleted\": 0`.\r\n\r\nAfter executing command I see nothing changed: size of `remote_content` folder is same, and `remote_media_cache` database table contains same records with older timestamps. Also no changes in `local_media_repository_url_cache` table.",
